    "detailed_description": "<strong>Immerse yourself in a classic game of chess set in the heart of the Middle Ages, where the pieces spring to life!</strong><br><br>This game immerses you in a low-poly environment where castles, resilient pawns, battle-hardened knights, and loyal bishops take the center stage. Employ your finest strategies to forge a path and capture your opponent's king's castle!<br><br>Game features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in a stunning 3D low-poly environment with a beautifully crafted chess scenario.<br></li><li>Watch as animated 3D pieces come to life on the battlefield.<br></li><li>Challenge the advanced AI with a choice of <strong>9 challenging difficulty levels</strong>.<br></li><li>Engage in epic <strong>online battles</strong> with friends or global rivals in private matches.<br></li><li>Experience the thrill of face-to-face matches with friends and family in <strong>offline mode</strong>.<br></li><li><strong>Preserve your progres</strong>s and continue your chess journey whenever you like.<br></li><li>Seamlessly switch between a <strong>3D perspective</strong> and the timeless <strong>2D view</strong>.<br></li><li>Command your pieces effortlessly using your keyboard, D-pad or Stick.<br></li><li>Feel free to orbit the camera around the chessboard and position it anywhere you like.<br></li><li>Select your preferred environment scenario, whether it's <strong>day</strong> or <strong>night</strong>.<br></li><li>Customize the AI's strategy by enabling or disabling the <strong>openings book</strong>.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Immerse yourself in a classic game of chess set in the heart of the Middle Ages, where the pieces spring to life!</strong><br><br>This game immerses you in a low-poly environment where castles, resilient pawns, battle-hardened knights, and loyal bishops take the center stage. Employ your finest strategies to forge a path and capture your opponent's king's castle!<br><br>Game features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in a stunning 3D low-poly environment with a beautifully crafted chess scenario.<br></li><li>Watch as animated 3D pieces come to life on the battlefield.<br></li><li>Challenge the advanced AI with a choice of <strong>9 challenging difficulty levels</strong>.<br></li><li>Engage in epic <strong>online battles</strong> with friends or global rivals in private matches.<br></li><li>Experience the thrill of face-to-face matches with friends and family in <strong>offline mode</strong>.<br></li><li><strong>Preserve your progres</strong>s and continue your chess journey whenever you like.<br></li><li>Seamlessly switch between a <strong>3D perspective</strong> and the timeless <strong>2D view</strong>.<br></li><li>Command your pieces effortlessly using your keyboard, D-pad or Stick.<br></li><li>Feel free to orbit the camera around the chessboard and position it anywhere you like.<br></li><li>Select your preferred environment scenario, whether it's <strong>day</strong> or <strong>night</strong>.<br></li><li>Customize the AI's strategy by enabling or disabling the <strong>openings book</strong>.</li></ul>",
